/Pg 26 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
503 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 162 0 R
/E (ClimateWatch exists to ensure that Pakistan's most climate-vulnerable communities, from the cryosphere regions of Gilgit-Baltistan to the flood plains of Sindh, are represented in climate policy decisions at every level, from local government to international negotiations.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
