/P 162 0 R
/E (The ICP Division tracks and analyzes Pakistan's engagement with global climate frameworks, including the UNFCCC, the Paris Agreement, and associated finance mechanisms. ClimateWatch has represented civil society at COP26, COP27, COP28, and SB64 \(Bonn, 2026\).)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [6]
>>
