/Title (The framework further examines an international lens to analyze the diplomatic credibility gap created by reducing domestic funds while seeking global loss and damage resources. Finally, a youth lens is deployed to explore the deep intergenerational injustices imposed on future generations by severely underfunding green skills development)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1279 0 R
/Prev 1405 0 R
>>
